Package: tottagpipe
Title: Pipeline to Process and Clean Data from TotTag Devices
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Christian", "Strauss", , "christian.strauss@vanderbilt.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-2536-4702"))
Description: This package processes, graphs, and cleans data offloaded from tottag devices. 
  The current pipeline requires properly organized and named .pkl files to run properly. 
  Using the primary function data_pipeline, these files are then converted to .Rdata files, 
  with the addition of variables designed to assess the quality of offloaded data. 
  Raw data can then be graphed creating a systematic .Rmarkdown file which provides text and 
  graphical quality metrics. Finally, data is cleaned utilizing user-inputted cut-offs for 
  defining likely off-body devices.
